name: Effective report counters survive repeated observations and human FP
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_trend.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 20 Labeled observation | initial-review
submit: campaigns
require-live-snap: 20 1 confirmed | one-canonical-confirmation
expect: 0% (0/1)
expect: $0.00 spent
ask: Does the workspace trend count one effective confirmation across two observations, without claiming source applicability or analysis completion?
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 20 Labeled observation | decision-target
paste-file: @ART/dismiss-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 run receipt | decision-saved
submit: campaigns
require-live-snap: 20 0 confirmed | fp-counters
expect: 100% (1/1)
expect: $0.00 spent
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_trend.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the later human FP replace the earlier confirmation in the trend while retaining both observations and decisions, with real SARIF and CI consumers in agreement?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: trend-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: trend-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: trend-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: trend-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: trend-40x12
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Esc compose | trend-narrow-reading
expect: 100% (1/1)
expect: 0 confirmed
keys: NPage
live-snap: trend-narrow-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: trend-narrow-page-2
ask: At all six sizes, can the operator read the current trend and its scope through visible controls without starting work or changing the decision?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | no-color-ready
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 20 Labeled observation | no-color-review
submit: campaigns
require-live-snap: 20 0 confirmed | no-color-trend
expect: 100% (1/1)
expect: $0.00 spent
resize: 160x48
live-snap: no-color-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: no-color-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: no-color-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: no-color-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: no-color-narrow
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Esc compose | no-color-narrow-reading
expect: 100% (1/1)
expect: 0 confirmed
keys: NPage
live-snap: no-color-narrow-page
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_trend.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recovered
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the effective FP totals, raw history and honest source limitations with zero model or scanner work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
